:: OC Evelyn Intro 1 [nobr]

As you are lying on the couch watching TV, you hear a noise from behind and look up to be instantly jumpscared by <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>, whose face sits a few inches from yours. You let out a scream of surprise and nearly fall off the couch as Noah gives you a confused look. <br>

